<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · text</p><h1 class="enc-title">Irish Declaration of Independence</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1919">1919</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Irish Declaration of Independence was adopted by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dail-eireann">Dáil Éireann</a>, the assembly of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sinn-fein">Sinn Féin</a> members elected in 1918, at its first meeting in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dublin">Dublin</a> on 21 January 1919. It ratified the Irish Republic proclaimed in 1916 and called on English forces to leave. The same day the first shots of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/irish-war-of-independence">Irish War of Independence</a> were fired.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/irish-declaration-of-independence.jpg" alt="Irish Declaration of Independence" width="300" height="482" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Irish_Declaration_of_Independence.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
